# The daemon staged for Tauri's `bundle.externalBin` as
# `hush-daemon-<target-triple>`. It is a build artifact of `cargo build -p
# hush-daemon` under a name Tauri looks for, not a source file; see
# scripts/stage-daemon-sidecar.sh.
apps/hush-tauri/src-tauri/binaries/

# Updater signing keys. A leaked private key lets anyone publish an update the
# app will happily install, so these never enter the repository. The default
# location is ~/.tauri, outside the tree, but a key generated in here must not
# be committable either.
*.key
.tauri/
